<title>FRANCE: France tax measures show a will for EMU - Juncker.</title>
<headline>France tax measures show a will for EMU - Juncker.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Measures announced on Monday by France to reduce its budget deficit show a will to meet Maastricht treaty criteria in 1997 and 1998, Luxembourg Prime Minister Jean-Claude Juncker said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;It shows that France is strongly committed to the date of January 1, 1999, and France is willing to meet the convergence criteria in 1997 and 1998,&quot; he told reporters after a meeting with French President Jacques Chirac.</p>
</text>
